 992:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_comp.c ****   * @brief  Return the output level (high or low) of the selected comparator.
 993:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_comp.c ****   *         On this STM32 series, comparator 'value' is taken before
 994:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_comp.c ****   *         polarity and blanking are applied, thus:
 995:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_comp.c ****   *           - Comparator output is low when the input plus is at a lower
 996:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_comp.c ****   *             voltage than the input minus
 997:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_comp.c ****   *           - Comparator output is high when the input plus is at a higher
 998:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_comp.c ****   *             voltage than the input minus
 999:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_comp.c ****   * @param  hcomp  COMP handle
1000:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_comp.c ****   * @retval Returns the selected comparator output level:
